  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/shadow-maint/shadow/zipball/4.20.4",
  "body": "shadow-4.20.4\r\n\r\nSecurity fixes:\r\n\r\n-  new[ug]idmap(1)\r\n   -  Use openat2(2) to avoid following symlinks and bind mounts.\r\n   -  Drop fd:N.\r\n\r\nRegression fixes:\r\n\r\n-  lib/nscd.h\r\n   -  Fix build error due to wrong type.\r\n      (regression introduced in 4.20.3)\r\n-  chfn(1)\r\n   -  Restore an error message that was accidentally made unreachable.\r\n      (regression introduced in 4.20.0)\r\n-  chpasswd(8)\r\n   -  Respect chroot/prefix when reading </etc/login.defs>.\r\n      (regression introduced in 4.12)\r\n-  groupmod(8)\r\n   -  Fix wrong database name in syslog(3) message.\r\n      (regression introduced in 4.1.3)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nBinary tarballs produced and signed with:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ git clean -dffx\r\n$ ./autogen.sh \r\n$ make -j4\r\n$ make dist\r\n$ gpg --detach-sign --armor shadow-4.20.4.tar.gz \r\n$ gpg --detach-sign --armor shadow-4.20.4.tar.xz\r\n```\r\n\r\nSource tarballs produced and signed with:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ git archive -o shadow-4.20.4_src.tar 4.20.4\r\n$ gpg --detach-sign --armor shadow-4.20.4_src.tar \r\n$ gzip -nk shadow-4.20.4_src.tar\r\n$ xz -k shadow-4.20.4_src.tar\r\n```"
}
